[00:00.00] 作曲 : De Backer
[00:50.21]A handsome stranger
[00:50.21]一位英俊的陌生人
[00:55.22]Gave me a ride
[00:55.22]让我搭了便车
[00:57.98]He had a suitcase full of lies
[00:57.98]他手提箱里装满谎言
[01:03.49]That he sold me
[01:03.49]全都卖给了我
[01:10.01]I sensed no danger
[01:10.01]我未察觉危险
[01:12.77]When I was there right by his side
[01:12.77]当我坐在他的身侧
[01:17.03]He said I compelled him to confide
[01:17.03]他说我让他卸下心防
[01:23.30]So he told me
[01:23.30]于是他告诉我
[01:28.06]Take this car
[01:28.06]开走这辆车
[01:32.82]And drive downstate
[01:32.82]一路向南行驶
[01:37.09]Then take off the licence plates
[01:37.09]然后拆下车牌
[01:41.85]And wait for me
[01:41.85]在原地等我
[01:49.87]I could have argued
[01:49.87]我本可以争辩
[01:52.63]But he said for my trouble I could keep
[01:52.63]但他说作为酬劳可留下
[01:57.14]Half the money in the bag on the back seat
[01:57.14]后座袋子里的一半钱财
[02:01.90]At least, that's what he told me
[02:01.90]至少他是这么说
[02:08.17]And he said he thought I looked trustworthy
[02:08.17]他说我看起来值得信赖
[02:12.68]And I must admit that the thrill of it all got the better of me
[02:12.68]必须承认这刺激让我鬼迷心窍
[02:17.44]So I drove down the highway with great speed
[02:17.44]于是我疾驰在高速公路上
[02:21.95]Until they resounded behind me
[02:21.95]直到身后警笛呼啸
[02:26.22]Sirens! The police
[02:26.22]警车！是警察
[02:50.22]They pull me over to the side of the road
[02:50.22]他们将我逼停在路边
[02:54.23]And tell me that the car was stolen, that's why I was followed
[02:54.23]告知这是赃车所以被追踪
[02:59.24]I try to tell them I was only doing what I was told
[02:59.24]我解释只是按指示行事
[03:03.50]But no, they won't listen to me
[03:03.50]但他们根本不愿听
[03:09.02]They cuff my hands and say
[03:09.02]他们铐住我说
[03:10.52]Now girl, the money, where did you hide it?'
[03:10.52]"姑娘 钱藏在哪里"
[03:14.03]Then I know without even checking the bag
[03:14.03]这时我不用看也知道
[03:16.04]That there's no money inside it
[03:16.04]袋子里根本没钱
[03:18.54]But when they read my rights
[03:18.54]当他们宣读权利时
[03:19.80]I know that it's no use
[03:19.80]我知道辩解无用
[03:21.05]Saying, I'm not lying'
[03:21.05]喊着"我没说谎"
[03:23.81]No, please let me go
[03:23.81]求你们放了我
[03:32.33]Please listen to me
[03:32.33]请听我说
[03:37.59]I am not guilty
[03:37.59]我是无辜的
[03:42.86]A handsome stranger tricked me
[03:42.86]被英俊陌生人欺骗
[03:45.11]Why did he have to hand-pick me?
[03:45.11]为何偏偏选中我
[03:48.12]He told me to take this car
[03:48.12]他让我开走这辆车
[03:53.39]And drive downstate
[03:53.39]一路向南行驶
[03:57.40]Then to take off the licence plates
[03:57.40]然后拆下车牌
[04:02.91]And wait there for him
[04:02.91]在原地等他
[04:08.93]But of course they don't believe me
[04:08.93]他们当然不相信
[04:10.18]So from there they drive me back to the station
[04:10.18]于是押我回警局
[04:13.69]And after I've been booked they began a three-day interrogation
[04:13.69]登记后开始了三天审讯
[04:18.95]I barely ate, I only slept an hour
[04:18.95]几乎没进食 只睡一小时
[04:20.71]But somehow I stayed patient and calm
[04:20.71]却奇迹般保持冷静
[04:25.22]They did me no harm
[04:25.22]他们没伤害我
[04:30.48]But the bag was the key to this mystery
[04:30.48]那个包是破案关键
[04:35.25]He bought it the very same day that he
[04:35.25]他在抢劫州际银行当天
[04:40.26]Robbed that bank upstate and then picked me
[04:40.26]买了它并选中我
[04:43.52]To be his fall guy patsy
[04:43.52]当他的替罪羔羊
[05:01.82]Five years later
[05:01.82]五年后
[05:06.08]When I'd almost forgotten that nightmarish day
[05:06.08]当我几乎忘记那噩梦之日
[05:10.09]I was struck by the handsome features of a stranger across the way
[05:10.09]街对面陌生人的英俊侧脸
[05:15.10]As he got out of a car, with a girl behind the wheel, and I heard him say
[05:15.10]猛然击中我 他下车时对驾驶座女孩说
[05:20.37]Take this car
[05:20.37]开走这辆车
[05:25.38]And drive downstate
[05:25.38]一路向南行驶
[05:32.90]Then take off the licence plates
[05:32.90]然后拆下车牌
[05:36.41]And wait for me
[05:36.41]在原地等我
